<title>FRANCE: Bollore nine-month sales slip.</title>
<headline>Bollore nine-month sales slip.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>First nine months of 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>Turnover					16,059    vs   16,443</p>
